 ## Limits and known issues
 
 - **US numbers only.** Geographic and toll-free numbers can be called; non-US, premium (900, 976) and US territory
   numbers cannot (`plugin/line/policy/destinations.py`).
-- **One live call so far.** Real hold lines, real phone menus, bridging, callbacks, codes into a live call, the
-  Grok path and holds longer than 30 minutes have not been tried on a real call. See the status table.
-- **Live call bug, fixed offline.** On the first live call Hermes went silent for about 39 s after the second reply. Fixed in L1 round 7 and replayed through the real ACP driver; not yet confirmed on a live call.
